# CODEOWNERS — requires an enabled "Require review from Code Owners"
# branch protection rule on master.
#
# Everyone in the group owns the repo root: every PR needs review from
# at least one code owner in addition to the required approvals.
#
# All owners must be on ONE line: repeating the same pattern on several
# lines keeps only the last one, silently dropping the earlier owners.
#
# WARNING: an owner without write access is not assigned as a code owner.
# @Kit-Kate and @nunosilv1 only count once they accept their pending
# collaborator invite.
